cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this project, please cite it as below."
title: "Blind Signature Accelerator — Open Hardware for RISC-V"
abstract: >-
  An open-source hardware accelerator for blind signature operations
  (blind RSA and blind Schnorr) targeting RISC-V soft cores on FPGA: a
  constant-time, formally-verified modular-arithmetic core, an MMIO
  peripheral, a PicoRV32 SoC integration, and a bare-metal Rust driver —
  built and verified end-to-end with a fully open toolchain.
type: software
authors:
  - name: "cong-or"
repository-code: "https://github.com/cong-or/blindsig-accel"
url: "https://blindsig-hardware.org"
version: "0.1.4"
date-released: 2026-09-08
license:
